      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "お父さんとお母さんは\r\nさっきみたいな魔物にやられたのかなと思って……。",
        "official_en": "I was just thinking...maybe Mom and Dad met their end against a monster like that...",
        "real_en": "I was wondering if a monster like the one we just fought killed Mom and Dad..."
